goal:   recommend (predict) useful questions based the previous analyzed study or
        what they need to practice, or what they need to practice.

recommended tech approach:   to use embeddings and similarity search, by representing each question as a vector.

note:           using embeddings directly on raw questions is not always enough!.

another note:   For an educational product, recommendation should not only be based on text similarity,
                It should also reflect educational meaning.

